<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pia 65-232b-14</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/3afe7257-1fd9-4be7-ba6a-f84e3f6dd275</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Michael Klaper</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Gunilla Iversen</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Ritva Maria Jacobsson</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-56d4bdcc-ffed-40e2-ba44-e7756e210721" endid="#m-741383a8-5c3a-4f18-a1f4-dce92ca1cce7"><table><tr><td><rend>((iessit))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((gessit))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-78c55f6c-2c62-44e7-a0b5-f68ae2e39dc5" endid="#m-216e5241-9c82-4195-96ca-4be19ab7e94b"><table><tr><td><rend>[[Gloria patri]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Hier ist wohl nicht gemeint, dass das [[Gloria patri]] zweimal gesungen werden soll. Die Angabe der Differenz zum Text [[seculorum amen]] in Teil D ist routinemäßiger Bestandteil der Angaben zum Psalmvers, das Inzipit [[Gloria patri]] der eigentlich redundante Hinweis auf den Vortrag der Doxologie, der hier notwendig ist, um die Position des folgenden Tropenelements unzweideutig anzugeben.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>((53, 54, 55:)) Hexameter.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pia-65"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pia 65</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pia 65-232b-14</identifier><title>Quem nasci</title><incip><incipText><p>Quem nasci</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="232b">f. 232b, l. 14</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Nat III intr 53 A 54 B 55 C D E 34 A (CT I)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-4</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Nativitas domini</term><term type="feast">3. Messe</term><term type="Editor">Michael Klaper</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">Puer natus</term><term type="Endseite">232b</term><term type="Endzeile">19</term><term type="FestUndGattung">Nat III intr</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pia 65</identifier><identifier type="cantus">Pia 65</identifier><titleStmt><title>Pia 65</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Piacenza</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen italienischer Herkunft</geogName><corpName role="origin-institution">Kathedrale</corpName><date>12. Jh Ende</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Tonar, Hymnar, Graduale, Kyriale, Tropar, Antiphonar</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">65</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Piacenza</geogName><corpName>Biblioteca Capitolare</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></